@startuml Sequence Diagram - Remove Team Member from Organization

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "OrganizationView" as OrgView
participant "ClerkAuth" as ClerkAuth
participant "Backend" as Backend

Admin -> OrgView : 1 Open organization members page
activate OrgView
OrgView -> OrgView : 2 Display members list view

Admin -> OrgView : 3 Select member to remove
Admin -> OrgView : 4 Click "Remove Member" button

OrgView -> OrgView : 5 Confirm removal action

OrgView -> ClerkAuth : 6 Send remove request
activate ClerkAuth
ClerkAuth -> Backend : 7 Remove member from organization
activate Backend
Backend -> Backend : 8 Update organization records
Backend -> ClerkAuth : 9 Confirmation
ClerkAuth -> OrgView : 10 Success notification
OrgView -> Admin : 11 Display success message

deactivate Backend
deactivate ClerkAuth
deactivate OrgView

@enduml
